    "1865902a-d85b-550b-bd0e-36486e716487": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "1. One line of air-quality warning that reaches a citizen",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 1.97,
        "extent": [
          -18924313.43,
          -7967317.54,
          21150703.25,
          14368684.28
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "*Aurora 1.5 + Aurora Air Pollution · story map*\n\nAurora is Microsoft Research's foundation model for the Earth system. This story follows it from a 48-hour forecast for New Delhi to a CPCB AQI, a GRAP stage and a message in Hindi, English and Korean. The map starts at the world and descends to India, the capital region, Delhi and the worst-hit site.\n\n### How results are labelled\n\n- **Aurora direct** — computed by an Aurora model from a real initial condition\n- **Additional method** — analysis added on top of Aurora output by statistics, rules or software (AQI conversion, stagnation rule, bias correction, delivery, scheduling)\n- **Synthetic** — example values produced without running the model (demo mode, stand-ins for data that needs an account)\n\n| Item | Source |\n| --- | --- |\n| Initial time | 2025-11-05 12:00:00 UTC |\n| Weather (mixing height, wind, temperature) | Aurora 1.5 (ARCO-ERA5 initial condition) — Aurora direct |\n| Pollutants (PM2.5, PM10, …) | synthetic — CAMS data needs an Atmosphere Data Store account, so stand-in values were used |\n| Ensemble | Aurora 1.5 Ensemble (3 members) — Aurora direct |\n| AQI, GRAP, stagnation rule, correction, delivery, scheduling | additional methods (CPCB formula, rules, least squares, software) |\n\nUse the ▶ button to move to the next scene; the map follows. In map scenes the ⓘ (Identify) button lets you click cells and sites for their values.\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
        "transition": {
          "type": "smooth",
          "time": 2.0
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "AQI 5 Nov 18:30 IST",
            "visible": false
          },
          {
