    "91508891-f045-5e80-bec6-b1fc6b74b3f0": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "4. Aurora appears twice",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 7.65,
        "extent": [
          8293302.06,
          3061141.04,
          9072538.5,
          3829123.84
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "*2 · System · Weather: Aurora 1.5 · Pollutants: synthetic (CAMS needs an account)*\n\n1. **Inputs** · CAMS global analysis 0.4° (PM, NO2, SO2, O3, CO + meteorology) · ERA5 or IFS HRES T0 0.25° (26 surface variables, 13 levels)\n2. **Aurora 0.4° Air Pollution** · 12 h × 4 = 48 h. Local GPU or the Foundry \"Aurora\" endpoint\n3. **Aurora 1.5** · 6 h × 8 + hourly sub-steps = 48 hourly fields (boundary-layer height, 10 m wind, temperature, dew point, rain, gusts)\n4. **Delhi post-processing** · 10-site interpolation → CPCB AQI → GRAP stage → stagnation (wind < 10 km/h, mixing height < 500 m) → hi/en/ko messages → push, SMS, WhatsApp, app\n\n**Why two models.** Aurora 1.5 is weather-only and predicts no pollutants, but gives **hourly** dispersion conditions. The Air Pollution model predicts concentrations directly, at 12-hour steps and 0.4°. Together they answer \"how high\" and \"from what hour tonight\".\n\n**What \"high resolution\" means.** (1) Time: hourly from 1.5 with `fine_lead_times=[1,…,6]`. (2) Space: the thin grid on the map is 1.5's 0.25° cells, bilinearly interpolated to ten sites. The grid itself cannot resolve intra-city differences (§6).\n\n**Linkages.** The repository's `msresearch-aurora/` (the Aurora skill from microsoft/vibe-kit) supplies a React map frontend, validation utilities and a fine-tuning starter. Checkpoints come from HuggingFace `microsoft/aurora`; without a GPU, `--mode foundry` submits to the Azure AI Foundry \"Aurora\" and \"Aurora-1.5\" endpoints.\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
        "transition": {
          "type": "smooth",
          "time": 2.0
        },
        "layerOverride": [
          {
            "targetLayer": "AQI 5 Nov 18:30 IST",
            "visible": true
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "AQI 6 Nov 02:30 IST",
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "targetLayer": "AQI 7 Nov 05:30 IST",
            "visible": false
