          "markdown": "*1 · Cast · Pollutants: synthetic (CAMS needs an account)*\n\n| Role | Wants | Output |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| General public | One line for tonight or tomorrow morning | `short` |\n| Sensitive groups, carers | Concrete actions and time windows | `long` |\n| Operators (DPCC/CAQM) | Peak time, GRAP basis, trend | `summary_by_site.csv`, `bulletin_*.md` |\n| Data/ML engineers | Reproducible pipeline | `--mode local|foundry` |\n\nMap: the AQI tile at the first forecast hour (5 Nov 18:30 IST). Colors are CPCB categories.\n",
