          "markdown": "*3 · S1 · S2 · Weather: Aurora 1.5 · Pollutants: synthetic (CAMS needs an account)*\n\nAt 12 UTC (17:30 IST) two `Batch` objects are built from the CAMS 00/12 UTC analysis and ERA5 06/12 UTC, plus the static pickles. Air Pollution runs 4 steps (+12/24/36/48 h); Aurora 1.5 runs 8 steps × 6 sub-steps (+1…+48 h) on one GPU or on Foundry. Ten minutes later the fields are interpolated to ten sites, the 12-hourly concentrations to hourly, and stagnant hours are flagged from 1.5's hourly mixing height and wind.\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
