          "markdown": "*3 · S3 · S4 · Pollutants: synthetic (CAMS needs an account) · Additional method*\n\nThe first forecast hour. All of Delhi is already \"Very Poor\" or worse, with traffic sites (Anand Vihar, ITO, Gurugram) highest. Per-site AQI and GRAP stage are computed and the one-line push/SMS message goes out; operators get a briefing with the city headline and per-site detail.\n\n**Citizen short message · Hindi**\n\n```text\n[वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] Anand Vihar: अधिकतम AQI 500 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 321 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।\n```\n\n**City headline**\n\n```text\nDelhi-NCR outlook: median peak AQI 433 (Severe); worst site Anand Vihar at AQI 500 (Severe) around 07 Nov 05:30 IST. Corresponds to GRAP Stage 4.\n```\n",
