        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "*Roadmap run 1 · uncertainty · Ensemble: Aurora 1.5 Ensemble · Additional method*\n\nAurora 1.5 Ensemble was run 3 times with different seeds (48 hourly steps each); each member's mixing height and wind decide stagnation, and the share of stagnant members is the probability. This is uncertainty the model computed.\n\nThe blue shading on the map is the per-cell stagnation probability at 7 Nov 05:30 IST (share of members with wind below 10 km/h and mixing height below 500 m). The table gives each site's mean probability for the first night (5 Nov 22:00 to 6 Nov 08:00), the day (6 Nov 08:00–22:00) and the second night, plus the 10th–90th percentile mixing height at the peak hour.\n\n| Site | Night 1 | Day | Night 2 | Peak BLH p10–p90 (m) |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| Anand Vihar | 3% | 21% | 43% | 79–107 |\n| ITO | 3% | 21% | 43% | 80–105 |\n| Punjabi Bagh | 12% | 24% | 50% | 86–101 |\n| Rohini | 12% | 28% | 50% | 87–100 |\n| Jahangirpuri | 12% | 28% | 50% | 85–102 |\n| R K Puram | 6% | 21% | 43% | 82–103 |\n| Dwarka Sector 8 | 18% | 26% | 50% | 88–99 |\n| Okhla Phase 2 | 0% | 19% | 40% | 78–107 |\n| Noida Sector 62 | 3% | 21% | 43% | 78–109 |\n| Gurugram Vikas Sadan | 18% | 26% | 57% | 86–95 |\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
        "transition": {
