    "92e764f6-9160-5a38-9019-5e5a6c5d9e42": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "17. Postal code → site → message",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.46,
        "extent": [
          8532638.97,
          3274212.69,
          8643958.46,
          3382011.46
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "*Roadmap run 4 · delivery adapter · Additional method*\n\nEach subscriber's postal code is mapped to the nearest site, the per-language `short` message becomes the payload and a delivery log is written. This run is a dry run, so items are logged as \"queued\"; a real adapter would POST to the WhatsApp Business API or an SMS gateway here.\n\n| Item | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Items | 20 |\n| Channel | dryrun |\n| Languages | en, hi |\n\n**Log sample**\n\n```text\nsub-000 · PIN 110092 · Anand Vihar · hi · queued (dry run) · 155 chars\n  [वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] Anand Vihar: अधिकतम AQI 500 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 321 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।\nsub-001 · PIN 110092 · Anand Vihar · en · queued (dry run) · 166 chars\n  [Air quality alert] Anand Vihar: peak AQI 500 (Severe) expected around 07 Nov 05:30 IST. Main pollutant PM10, PM2.5 up to 321 ug/m3. Even healthy people are affected.\nsub-002 · PIN 110002 · ITO · hi · queued (dry run) · 147 chars\n  [वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] ITO: अधिकतम AQI 498 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 318 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।\n```\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
