    "276514ce-c832-51da-9660-4adc760257b7": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "18. Re-issue at 00 and 12 UTC",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 7.65,
        "extent": [
          8293302.06,
          3061141.04,
          9072538.5,
          3829123.84
        ],
        "enableIdentify": false,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "markdown",
          "markdown": "*Roadmap run 5 · automation · Additional method*\n\nThe cron script generated by the pipeline. It runs at 02:30 and 14:30 UTC (08:00 and 20:00 IST), after the analyses arrive, and writes outputs to a dated folder. The data in this story map are themselves the result of the same command (`delhi_aq.py`).\n\n```bash\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Re-issue the Delhi air-quality bulletin after each 00/12 UTC analysis becomes available.\n# crontab -e  ->  30 2,14 * * *  /path/to/run_delhi_aq_cron.sh >> /var/log/delhi_aq.log 2>&1\nset -euo pipefail\ncd \"$(dirname \"$0\")\"\npython delhi_aq.py --mode foundry --hours 48 --plot --out \"outputs/$(date -u +%Y-%m-%dT%H)\" -v\n```\n",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": ""
        },
        "transition": {
